### Normalized scores (1–100)

**Tool use: 86/100.** Estimated based on pro tier performance and typical MiMo model characteristics. Caps: strong but not top-tier; good for general-purpose work.

**Reasoning: 87/100.** Estimated based on rank ~30-50 on AI Intelligence Index for pro tier. Caps: good reasoning with solid capabilities across domains.

**Context window: 95/100.** ~1M tokens typical for Pro tier. Caps: good but not the highest; suitable for long documents and RAG.

**Multimodal: 95/100.** Text + image input, text output. 1M context supports documents and images. Caps: standard multimodal for pro models.

**Coding: 86/100.** Estimated based on pro tier coding capabilities. Caps: strong coding but not specialized.

**Cost efficiency: 78/100.** Estimated $2-4/M input, $10-18/M output. 80-90% cache discount. Competitive pricing for pro tier. Caps: good value for money.

**Overall Score: 87/100.** Mean of Tool (86) + Reasoning (87) + Context (95) + Multimodal (95) + Coding (86) = 88.4. Solid pro model with good performance across all domains; competitive alternative to top-tier proprietary models.

